xpectedly perverted. She aims for Keita's chastity."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5810"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab35e8105ff7efa25cad32cde1ba822cd3204ef421d31b1b9fdc052f09e976ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/439684672a85da84320dbefef326c71f0caea3cdf1681515dd473207cafd3500.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"南里 一花","creatorId":"vndb:s928","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s928","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s928","name":"羽月 理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45228","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5811","characterName":"須藤 美緒","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5811"},"originalCharacterName":"須藤 美緒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mio is a second grade high school student and classmate of the protagonist. She is a class president and a serious and meddlesome person. She is Keita's close friend and Tomoka's senior at her workplace."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hates her brother because of his perverted speech. She occasionally helps with the student council work along with Keita because she is worried about him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She can sometimes be gentle and sometimes harsh."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5811"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/645b566c6f5cf833df6b856e1e1eb265f967b894ecc7831546fe318172c007a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95f160efd794486d5b602230